This is what was added in the last update:

- two new missions (you can get them from the pigeon);
 - beware of the cops! a new event has been added with them;
 - another new house with interiors appeared;
 - fixed a bug with a flood in the boss's house;
 - now the cops leave the boss's house (before they always stood there).

We remind you that we are actively preparing for the launch of multiplayer.
Also in honor of Wanted Raccoon's birthday we made a 50% discount on the game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/cdf36f25e869da852ed3fd044b902c695e1b4cd7.png[/img]

Hi! 

Here it is - bugfix + update:

- Added 3 repeatable quests to the junkyard: collecting building materials from the beaver, obtaining food from the squirrel and obtaining parts from the hedgehog;

 - Fixed some bugs in the plot, such as a double hedgehog car, one did not turning off;

 - Fixed a bug with boxes falling through the ground;

 - New houses with interiors near the boss's house were added.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/38f02268c1343d21394fe695337d06216646e833.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/ad83ae9c2c3b5d8b4884626f1306d193511a2d36.png[/img]

Hello!

Year draws to a close, and it means that the Steam Winter Sale is coming soon - add the game to your wishlist so you don't forget about the discount!

And one more reason to save Wanted Raccoon to your list - we have prepared an update of the game for the New Year, here's what it has now:

  - added more sounds!
  - new animations for characters;
  - fixed bugs with coins and quest items falling underground, as well as a bug with snow;
  - fixed a bug with the replacement of control keys and other minor bugs;
  - some tasks were not counted as completed by the player - now everything is OK with it;
  - added snowfall!

We are glad to present you the next update of our game!
Now Wanted Raccoon has:
  - question marks over characters;
  - new mission: save the hedgehog!
  - mole burrows are now scattered around the game world, through which you can make fast travel (will be available after saving the mole);
  - the interior of another house in the city - now you can visit it;
  - added Polish language to the game :)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/86e48d75f455263e2580e39d9145e2462021f906.jpg[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/b6358dc6ed809cd7b2c098232682bf449f79f63f.png[/img]

Well, we are happy to introduce you the next update of our game!

So for today, we've added to the game:
- changing timе of the day;
- dynamic weather change;
- several house interiors (but not every interior is open yet, working on it)
- Halloween decorations for Halloween time!
- improved optimization;
- a new mission "Mole’s saving";
- mole’s ability to make quick movements around the location;
- fixed the problems with street traffic;
- increased skate stability;
- improved the current task pointer.

Today we released an update⭐️

 • added a new enemy - a dog!
 • a new squirrel rescue mission;
 • a new resource - food (it will be possible to use the abilities of saved friends with it);
 • new weapon: now you can find a glass bottle in trash cans that you can use to stun enemies.[previewyoutube=2lM6E0w44w0;rightthumb][/previewyoutube]

NEWS! Discount week on Steam: 40% discount on Wanted Raccoon from May 16 to May 22.
Also we released an [previewyoutube=Emzqm95d4Cg;leftthumb]update[/previewyoutube]:
- made the storyline more free;
- removed some cutscenes;
- added gunpowder to the merchant;
- now you can craft a grenade in the game!
- and fixed a number of bugs.
Go :)

Hello everyone!

We are happy to introduce you our latest updates in Wanted Raccoon:
- Added "Load" button to  the pause menu;
- Fixed bugs;
- Added the opportunity to customise your character;
- There are more opportunities for the base construction;
- Stylised Halloween game world.

We also want to remind you that starting October 28th, Wanted Raccoon went on Halloween sale! You can get it at 40% DISCOUNT until November 1st!

Don't miss this pleasant event:
[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1320100/Wanted_Raccoon/]https://store.steampowered.com/app/1320100/Wanted_Raccoon/[/url]

Trick or treat? 🎃

[previewyoutube=BpXLnoBAfC8;full][/previewyoutube]

👋 We say hello to everyone!
 Here is a small list of what we have corrected / changed:
 -Fixed minor bugs in error messages;
 -Improved Ragdoll characters;
 -Fixed drawing range of some objects;
 -Improved optimization;
 -Fixed hissing when entering the main menu;
 -Saving now takes up less space (4-8 times less).

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/e283ec0a519e5370f147e5191cdfcf301393dd0f.png[/img]

Hey!
We share the updates released in the last patch in June:

1. A problem with darts getting stuck in the Raccoon when he rides a skateboard is solved;
2. Controllers are set up;
3. Now the fire extinguisher could run out;
4. A new mission is added;
5. Craft is added;
6. Dump is increased;
7. Some animations are fixed;
8. New sounds are added;
9. New items are added;
10. The ability to ride a skateboard with a plunger-harpoon is added;
11. More stone spawn points are added.

And we are very pleased to take stock of our work since the release of Wanted Raccoon into Early Access, which we all have been waiting for!
Let's see (or see) how many updates our Raccoon went through to become a game you can play today (:

2021/03/23:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/27ad01a18e0b7eaffbaea39d3dd974e12c26f972.jpg[/img]

1. The problem with a black screen on PC with UHD 610-630 video cards (now if you disable postprocessing in graphic settings the problem is gone);
2. Trapwire now can be placed not only near the doors;
3. You can take a tripwire in inventory;
4. The plot works correctly if NPC was stunned or tied up ahead of time;
5. The problem with some missing colliders on objects;
6. The player no longer appears in the kennel while catching at the construction site;
7. Getting stuck in boss pickup and garbage truck after loading the game is fixed;
8. The problem with saving is fixed (but broken save, unfortunately, cannot be restored);
9. The problem with turning on sleep effects in the city after a dart hit;
10. Fixed some missing icons;
11. Added a warning about the end of available storyline;
12. Fixed drawing range on some objects;
13. The robbery room problem is fixed (when it was possible to get stuck it in);
14. Spilled cement not really slow down builders!
15. The activation time of some traps and destruction is reduced;
16. The problem with resetting the timer for activating the trap or binding the mob is fixed;
17. The problem with the crane that blocked the entrance to the junkyard after loading the game;
18. The problem with a number of points in the task "destroy the boss's house" is solved;
19. Now the player can exit the stealth mode (he could not stop sneaking before);
20. The problem when the Pirate raccoon did not go to the next point in the junkyard;
21. The problem with the Pirate raccoon when he did not pick up the part from the crane is fixed;
22. The problem with the inability to leave the box if the player was inside it when saving;
23. White screen problem is fixed.

From the previous patch:
1. The problem with the ball that sometimes fell through the ground is solved;
2. A rope reel near the gardeners' house is added;
3. The time for drawing water into the sink during a flood in the boss's house is accelerated;
4. Flushing mobs with a hydrant now works correctly;
5. The problem with getting the key from the boss's room is fixed;
6. Incorrect pointer for setting trap in last dream is also fixed.

2021/03/31:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/d6c857e1675678227bb39fcb571831496e2c0e79.png[/img]

1. Added a new mission: Rescuing Old Joe;
2. Added resource warehouse interface;
3. The mission with building a wind generator works correctly now;
4. Buildings that you built are saved now;
5. The state and position of the doors can also be saved;
6. The problem with the rope during deliveries is solved;
7. More zones for construction were added;
8. The problem with the doors that couldn’t be opened is solved;
9. Robbery planning room was added;
10. Colliders were added to scene objects;
11. Reliability of the saving was improved;
12. Additional respawn points were added;
13. The reference to MGS at bus stops were removed;
14. The problem when Jack the Raccoon could not reach the dump after the construction site is also solved;
15. And finally we made lots of minor bug fixes from bug reports.

2021/04/18:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/bb5b28d47aaa481c665158d2009f8021ac237e84.png[/img]

Base building is added.

2021/05/05:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/09ab56ad92d85ab403a725397711310099789443.png[/img]

1. Sounds for different game situations were added;
2. Inverse kinematics for all characters was configured, i.e. now they do not sink into the ground;
3. Ragdolls on all characters were configured, now they fall down more realistically;
4. English translation of the game was improved;
5. The option of selection of other languages was added to the game menu: Russian, Chinese, Ukrainian. And in the near future we will add German, Portuguese, Italian, etc .;
6. The plot has become freer; there are no unnecessary cut scenes;
7. Problems with control settings were fixed;
8. Problem with the area of cargo delivery to the crane was fixed;
9. New location was added at the entrance to the city – Raccoon City Park;
10. Now you can destroy more objects in the boss's house (for ex., drop a laptop, phone, chandeliers, and etc.);
11. The reliability of saving was improved;
12. The bug with boxes that blocked the cargo container with the Raccoon-trader was fixed;
13. The interval of patrols in the kennel in the mission of rescuing the old raccoon was increased;
14. Overturned boards, barrels, boxes and etc. now return to their places after the player’s respawn;
15. Skateboard control was improved;
16. Minor bugs and shortcomings were fixed;
17. Crafting and trading were improved, more new improvements are coming in the next updates!

2021/06/03:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/26bd033caf628f30d3be19748effc144c31f726d.png[/img]

1. The issue with the respawn is fixed;
2. The non-working dialogues are fixed;
3. Xbox controller support is added;
4. Flying trees are fixed;
5. Some locations are improved;
6. The bug with the crane in the cargo delivery mission is solved;
7. The disabling physics on the tail after respawning is fixed;
8. Names of characters are now highlighted in dialogues with different colors;
9. Translations have been improved and new languages added: Portuguese, French and Spanish!


Of course, we will continue to work on improving Wanted Raccoon and post new patches with updates.
Thank you for your active feedback that help us improve the game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/09ab56ad92d85ab403a725397711310099789443.png[/img]

Full list of updates:

1. Sounds for different game situations were added (and there will be more in the next updates);
2. Inverse kinematics for all characters was configured, i.e. now they do not sink into the ground;
3. Ragdolls on all characters were configured, now they fall down more realistically;
4. English translation of the game was improved;
5. The option of selection of other languages was added to the game menu: Russian, Chinese, Ukrainian. And in the near future we will add German, Portuguese, Italian, etc .;
6. The plot has become freer; there are no unnecessary cut scenes;
7. Problems with control settings were fixed;
8. Problem with the area of cargo delivery to the crane was fixed;
9. New location was added at the entrance to the city – Raccoon City Park;
10. Now you can destroy more objects in the boss's house (for ex., drop a laptop, phone, chandeliers, and etc.);
11. The reliability of saving was improved;
12. The bug with boxes that blocked the cargo container with the Raccoon-trader was fixed;
13. The interval of patrols in the kennel in the mission of rescuing the old raccoon was increased;
14. Overturned boards, barrels, boxes and etc. now return to their places after the player’s respawn;
15. Skateboard control was improved;
16. Minor bugs and shortcomings were fixed;
17. Crafting and trading were improved, more new improvements are coming in the next updates!

[previewyoutube=9z964xF-pMg;full][/previewyoutube]

Hello everyone!

We haven’t been here with the news for a long time because we were working on a number of new interesting updates (:
A new location (Raccoon City Park) has been added to Wanted Raccoon, there are more sounds in it and the plot is freer now.
Also we understood that there’s not enough to have only the English language in the game, and immediately after the release into Early Access we fell into the work with translations. Today in addition to English the game already has a choice of Russian, Chinese and Ukrainian languages. And further - onwards and upwards) We’ll add German, Italian, Portuguese and other languages.
Many thanks to the guys for their help with translations: Horace Pan (Chinese), RoW-Team (Ukrainian) And Philipp J. Rackl (German)!
If you want to help us to translate the game into your language, write to us!

Friends, in the last patch we tried to fix many problems that you mentioned in your feedbacks, letters and bug reports. So here is the list of new bug fixes that, thanks to you, significantly improved the gameplay process in Wanted Raccoon. Please install the update and launch the game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/d6c857e1675678227bb39fcb571831496e2c0e79.png[/img]

1. Added a new mission: Rescuing Old Joe;
