3. The mission with building a wind generator works correctly now;
4. Buildings that you built are saved now;
5. The state and position of the doors can also be saved;
6. The problem with the rope during deliveries is solved;
7. More zones for construction were added;
8. The problem with the doors that couldn’t be opened is solved;
9. Robbery planning room was added;
10. Colliders were added to scene objects;
11. Reliability of the saving was improved;
12. Additional respawn points were added;
13. The reference to MGS at bus stops were removed;
14. The problem when Jack the Raccoon could not reach the dump after the construction site is also solved;
15. And finally we made lots of minor bug fixes from bug reports.

The next update will content a new location, new sounds, a full base building. We will also continue to fix all the bugs and problems you report about.

